estion", "contents": {"type": "", "content": "that the review be published ahead of the book release."}}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}], "id": 2}, {"responses": [{"selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "It is hoped"}], "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob07re6aud11"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"type": "", "content": "that a favorable review will create some buzz around the book."}}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}], "id": 3}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "type": "TYP", "id": 4}, {"_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "type": "RSLT", "id": 5}], "stimuli": [], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Next Step"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Do You Review the Review?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 15}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "  Describe the reasons or results of events or actions in spoken or written texts, in work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn11le15ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " -ing Forms"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you want to talk about results and time, you can use a <span class=\"strong\"> Perfect - ing</span> form. You use this type of structure when you want to emphasize that one thing happens before another. It can have the same meaning as <span class=\"strong\">because</span>. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\"> Having published </span>a lot of children's books, I know how crucial the first reviews are.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In this case, the action that comes first is <span class=\"italic\">\"Having published a lot of books\"</span>. It is clear that the action <span class=\"italic\">\"I know how crucial the first reviews are.\" </span>comes next."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The meaning is: <span class=\"italic\">I know how crucial the first reviews are <span class=\"strong\">because </span>I have published a lot of books</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The form of the Perfect - ing is:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Having + past participle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take a look at the examples from the text. Think about which event happened first."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Yes, anticipating a good response, I read a review that I saw on a blog this morning. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Knowing of her concern for her kids' safety on the internet, I knew she would be interested in the book."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Having so many options for illustrators, it was hard to choose the best one for this book."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Having seen first-hand how valuable that hype can be, I'm really pleased with this review, too."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Report Verbs with Impersonal Passive Construction"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you want to report a fact or belief, you can use a variety of ways to construct your ideas. When you do not want to mention the source of the information, you can use a passive structure.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the structure <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">It + passive verb + that + finite clause</span></span>. <br/> A finite clause contains a verb which shows tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">For example:<br/> <span class=\"strong\">It was reported</span> that the army was crossing the frontier. <br/> <span class=\"strong\">It has been shown</span> that the theory is correct. <br/> <span class=\"strong\">It is proposed</span> that prices should increase next year.</span> <br/>  <br/>We often use these verbs for reporting with impersonal passive construction: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":14,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"admit \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"explain\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"prove\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"agree\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fear\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"recommend\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"allege\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"find\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"regret\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"announce\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hope\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"report\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"assume\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"intend\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"reveal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"believe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"know\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"see\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"claim\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mention\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"consider\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"notice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"state\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"declare\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"suggest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"discover\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"observe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"suppose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"establish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"presume\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"think\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"estimate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"promise\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"understand\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"propose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's agreed that this is the best location for this type of launch."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It was decided that it was better to make the focus about the kids even though we need to sell the book to the parents."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It was assumed that if the kids were engrossed in the parts that Marisa reads, then the parents will buy the book. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It wasn't understood that she would review it but she did and she loved it."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's known that pre-release hype is the best way to increase sales so I'm really pleased that she added that to her review. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "advance copy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a copy of a book received before it is published"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I gave an advance copy to a friend of mine because she has kids."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about work and customer relations."}]}, {"type": "ta