val "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That's high praise!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a review of a book you read, a movie or play you saw, a restaurant that you went to, or anything else that you want."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the experience."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write about what you liked and disliked and why."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Exchange reviews with a partner. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe something that I experienced."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about what I like and disliked about the experience."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I exchange reviews with a partner and read my partner's review."}]}], "type": "sena"}